figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">자! 그러면 범인은 누구일까요?<br><br>바로 태양빛에 따라 옷의 색이 변하는 옷을 입고 있던 귀족 여성입니다.<br>마인크래프트 맵에서는 귀족 여성이 햇빛알러지가 있었다는 내용으로 전달을 하며 추리를 마무리했습니다. <br><br>나머지는 ‘수사노트’인데요! 과학원리를 담은 내용입니다. 사진 첨부하겠습니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d41937f76db192b1df6dee38cb1e05e56ae3af87\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d41937f76db192b1df6dee38cb1e05e56ae3af87\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"534\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ea626fd9417bd846bc25d973bfa73d7892a66664\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ea626fd9417bd846bc25d973bfa73d7892a66664\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"592\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fed296654a6b389d35f38058d638120b8e15e4f4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fed296654a6b389d35f38058d638120b8e15e4f4\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"574\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5589b4f27d48be278490a77e35cede8611ca8145\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5589b4f27d48be278490a77e35cede8611ca8145\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"580\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
